  "releaseNotes": "Fixed a compatibility issue with Azure Functions where synchronous stream parsing caused a System.InvalidOperationException. Replaced JsonDocument.Parse with JsonDocument.ParseAsync in BulkProcessor.SaveAsync to comply with async I/O requirements. Refactored JsonDataReader to accept a pre-parsed JsonDocument, improving separation of concerns and stream lifecycle control. These changes enhance hosting compatibility and align with ASP.NET Core best practices.",
